virglrenderer: upstream !1685 (open MR) for Venus on macOS with KosmicKrisp.
- !1685 vkr: import shared memory as host memory (VK_EXT_external_memory_host) instead of an MTLBuffer.
  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/virgl/virglrenderer/-/merge_requests/1685
(The fence pipe fallback for macOS, formerly !1688 here, now comes with the render server changes
of virglrenderer-04-neptune.patch.)

